maml:description.maml:para:
Files to upload: hashtables @{ container; path (the local file);
name (in the container; the file's name by default); contentType }.
Uploaded only when new or changed (MD5); up to 256 MB each.

command:example.dev:code:
Get-AACAdvisorRecommendation -Category Cost |
    Group-Object SavingsCurrency |
    ForEach-Object { '{0} {1:N2} per month' -f $_.Name, ($_.Group | Measure-Object MonthlySavings -Sum).Sum }

maml:description.maml:para:
As a .psd1 or .json file, or a hashtable:
  @{ Spaces = @(
         @{ Name = 'Corp'; Description = '...'; Blocks = @(
             @{ Name = 'Azure-EU'; Cidr = '10.20.0.0/14' }
             @{ Name = 'Azure-US'; Cidr = '10.24.0.0/14' } ) } )
     External = @( @{ Name = 'London DC'; Cidr = '10.0.0.0/16' } ) }

Write an interactive HTML inventory of the resources to this file
instead of showing the view. An existing file is overwritten;
missing folders are created.
